  "title": "Qt: Follow Stream stream and substream spinboxes keyboard handling",
  "description": "Don't disable the stream and substream spinboxes when a tap is\nin progress, but set them to readonly. When disabled, they can't\nhave focus, which causes focus to shift to a button when changing\nthe stream id via keyboard.\n\nEnsure that the spinboxes have keyboard tracking off, so that\nvalueChanged is only emitted when Enter is pressed or focus changes,\ninstead of with each number input. (This may differ by default on\ndifferent platforms and themes, so ensure it's off.)\n\nFix #18264",
